12. Limited Release Validation

Document says:

System shall support Limited Release

These are products that cannot be freely ordered.

Example:

New product launch.

Only approved hospitals can receive it.

System checks:

Customer Approved?
      ↓
      Yes → Continue
      No → Error

Usually validation comes from:

ZS10 table
Customer entitlement list
Product release list
13. SAP Integration Logic

After order submission, WIO sends payload to SAP.

Example configuration:

Country	Request Type	SAP Order Type
Taiwan	STC	KB
Other Country	STC	ZKB

This is controlled by:

BR-001

Configurable mapping.

Example:

User selects:

Country = Taiwan
Request Type = STC
Reason = Fill Up

System determines:

Order Type = KB
Stock Location = STC
Reason Code = B01

Then SAP payload is generated.

